OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after man injured
OL,4,Ain Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fman was found injured in Aberdeen.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FSeaview Road at about 09:00.
OL,12,FA 42-year-old man has been taken to
OL,13,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,15,FA 46-year-old woman and two men, aged
OL,16,F36 and 48, have been arrested in
OL,17,Fconnection with the incident.
